        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 22251, Ornate Narrow Plate Latchset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFit for royalty, door latchset features luxurious embellishments on the lever and the plate. This Interior Fancy Narrow Plate Leverset is not for people who want to make a simple statement—it exudes richness that will lend its ornate styling well to fancier home décors. The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. For interior doors with 1-3/8\" thicknesses and either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. It is ADA compliant. Available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, or privacy functions. It is available in polished brass and shaded bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08HE_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Narrow Plate Fancy Door Lever Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Interior Fancy Narrow Plate Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets ADA accessibility requirements.</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>All critical interior parts are made of brass. Tough, non-rusting materials are used throughout.</li>\r\n<li>For commercial and residential use.</li>\r\n<li>For interior use only.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy function features a privacy mortise bolt constructed of a metal case and featuring a solid brass bolt underneath the lever and latch. It has an emergency release on outside plate.</li>\r\n<li>The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. <b>Does Not</b> fit standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Fancy Narrow Rose With Fancy Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Height: 11-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backplate Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Privacy Function Turnpiece: 1-5/8\" x 1-1/8 proj.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy</b>: For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. It does not lock and does not latch. Complete set includes: 1 lever, 1 backplate, and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. It does not lock and does not latch. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 backplates, and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates by lever from either side of door. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 thru-bolt assembly backplates, tubular latch, spindle and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Upper latch operates by lever from either side of door. Locks by privacy bolt with turnpiece on inside an emergency release on outside plate. Complete set includes: 2 levers, 2 thru-bolt assembly backplates, spindle, mounting hardware, privacy turnpiece, lever operated tubular latch, and thumbturn operated privacy mortise bolt and case.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/lcn-4010-series-closer.jpg?v=1704354577\" width=\"177\" height=\"140\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Interior Fancy Narrow Plate Leverset",
                "description": "Ornate Narrow Plate Latchset Omnia 22251  - Fit for royalty, door latchset features luxurious embellishments on the lever and the plate. This Interior Fancy Narrow Plate Leverset is not for people who want to make a simple statement—it exudes richness that will lend its ornate styling well to fancier home décors. The narrow escutcheon plate is surface mounted. For  interior doors with 1-3/8 inch thicknesses and either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is ADA compliant. Available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, or privacy functions. It is available in polished brass and shaded bronze finishes.",
                "keywords": "Ornate Narrow Plate Latchsets, Interior Fancy Narrow Plate Leversets, Elegant Narrow Rose With Ornate Levers, omnia narrow plate latchsets, ada levers, passages levers, privacy levers, fancy levers, high end levers, traditional levers, ornate levers, OMN-22251, Omnia 22251"
